      "answer": "Temporary field mappings planned in the router transform for the MapleHarvest Quebec pilot include mapping txn_id to transaction_id, total_amount to amount_cents, performing type coercion from string to int, preserving key fields store_id and register_id, and adding a transformation flag field _ns_transform=true. This transform is to be deployed in the SI-CLOUD-ROUTER component as a temporary measure to address schema rejection issues caused by mixed field names/types from store-level preprocessing.\n\nThe March 23 workshop is a Schema Signoff Workshop intended to produce an agreed canonical schema for payment, register_events, and sensor_thermo events. Attendees include Sophie Tremblay, Marc Gauthier, Ellen Park, Platform engineers, and Northstar SE/Ing teams. The deliverable from this workshop is a signed schema document uploaded to SI-SCHEMA-REG and a change control ticket with producer migration milestones.\n\nThese details come from the MapleHarvest Quebec Pilot project reset and mitigation plan and related coordination notes [art_5a91258f4056], [art_6c5bb3a4b89f].",
