      "answer": "The SCIM fields conflicting at Aureum were \"department\" and \"businessUnit.\" Merchant Services used \"businessUnit=merchant\" while Payments Ops used \"department=payments.\" Jin proposed a fast fix to add a preprocessing rule in Signal Ingest to map \"businessUnit\" to \"department\" (or vice versa) and publish a normalized field for the correlator. This fix is a configuration-only change, hot-reloadable, and low risk, which avoids the need to wait for Okta change control. This approach allows a quick remediation without modifying Okta flows, which would require a 2\u20134 week change control process [art_79f625aafa16].",
